{
  "_readme": [
    "Study spots added by hand, for places OpenStreetMap misses or mis-tags.",
    "The seed script imports these alongside the OSM results.",
    "",
    "Fields:",
    "  key            required. A stable id for this entry. Never change it once",
    "                 used, or the seed script will create a duplicate instead",
    "                 of updating. Stored as osm_id 'manual/<key>'.",
    "  name           required.",
    "  category       required. One of: library, cafe, dining_hall, classroom,",
    "                 coworking, outdoor.",
    "  lat, lng       required. Find them by right-clicking the spot in Google",
    "                 Maps and copying the two numbers it shows.",
    "  osm_id         optional. If the place IS in OpenStreetMap, put its id",
    "                 here ('way/123', 'node/456', 'relation/789') and this",
    "                 entry will update that same record instead of duplicating",
    "                 it.",
    "  address        optional.",
    "  opening_hours  optional, in OpenStreetMap syntax, e.g.",
    "                 'Mo-Fr 08:30-22:00; Sa-Su 10:00-18:00'. LEAVE IT OUT if",
    "                 you are not sure: a wrong value makes the app claim a",
    "                 place is open when it is shut. Blank just shows",
    "                 'Hours not known yet'.",
    "  hours_note     optional free text for things the syntax cannot express,",
    "                 e.g. 'Shorter hours during reading week'.",
    "",
    "Coordinates below were looked up from OpenStreetMap, not guessed.",
    "Opening hours are deliberately left blank — please fill them in as you",
    "confirm them on the ground."
  ],

